 "job": {
  "owner": "Claude H-SM faces-mclk helper 0945",
  "branch": "claude/hsm-faces-mclk-1016",
  "tag": "mclkB",
  "purpose": "Additive q2 face-local clocks: existing recipe3 input state and existing response state, no new edges. Physical grant/native proof required.",
  "structural_change": "Native v16 ABI master for NW (RG5/WG3; die netlist main 04fad9220 binds hfd_vms_bank_native_q*, strap masters retired). Same body as strap6: strap5 write tree (payload zeroed at its own pin capture, lv_rep removed), SECDED flip on the D edge. nat2: recipe-3 pin register on every input (+1 edge per input, uniform; native q2 nat1 TT -59.5 = 35 input->reg endpoints, valid pin -> ~281 masking ANDs; reg->reg +60.5), outputs stay RTL registers, EG_WIDE=1 (strap5 q0 TT -114.94: 21/22 violators packet/COLL leaf -> egress pin clones; native q2 gate nat1 placement reg->reg -115.9 at eg_d[10], same egress pattern; equivalence 0 mismatches at RG5/WG2, RG4/WG2, RG5/WG3). Pins: v4 strap grant N/S/W + E face = strap q2 E (0.144 um) minus rq5/rr5 (results/arch/hbm_die_v16/vm_native_bank_grants_0600.json).",
  "extra_paths": [
   "rtl/hbm_accel/generic/vm/static",
   "physical/hbm_vm_native_1016/q2",
   "results/arch/hbm_die_v16/vm_native_bank_grants_0600.json",
   "physical/common_flow/assigned_pin_exact.tcl",
   "physical/common_flow/macro_channel_block.tcl",
   "physical/common_flow/clock_entries.tcl"
  ],
  "record_to": "results/rtl/ref_tile/vm_native_q2_faces_g313",
  "views_to": "physical/ref_tile/vm_native_q2_faces_g313/views",
  "benches": [
   {
    "name": "exact_real_memory",
    "cmd": "bash rtl/hbm_accel/generic/vm/static/faces_q2/run.sh {RUN}/bench/q2_faces",
